PD: Any final words of wisdom for a beginning writer? 
JW: It’s ¶ take a lot longer than you think, and don’t give up. Just 
keep writing. 
There was a guy I went to USC with whom I used ī every year at a 
New Year’s party. And every year I’d ask him what he was doing. He told 
me what he was working on, and I realized é Ã thing he was 
working on last year. That went on for three or four years. You ä be 
