title will probably change; think of it as a toe in a doorway. Underneath, 
identify the franchise or general category (i.e., teen ³, sitcom, polit¬ 
ical thriller, dramedy...). If it’s based on something (book, play, movie, 
cartoon) you’d better say so, but make sure Ä clear rights ¥ 
underlying work. Your credit is “Written By” or “Created By” and that 
