Why bother Ún establishing shot ¡ Precinct in #9? Think of a 
reason before I tell you. Okay, here are a few: It helps re-orient viewers 
to “home base” after several beats ¢ field; it signals the beginning of 
a new sequence; and it creates an ellipsis — that is, an impression time 
