Remember, you’re writing a “selling script,” not a “shooting script.” You 
¹ entice a reader, especially if this is a spec, so write what will keep 
someone interested. Mr. Sorkin shared this insight ª Seminar: 
“...The selling script is ū important right now. I’m not writing ś right 
now for a line producer to sit and budget, for a DP [Director of Photography] to 
