STEP DEAL. A writing contract which provides “cut offs” after each step 
of writing. For example, if ą’s outline doesn’t work for ·, he 
ò cut off, not hired to proceed to ¿ draft. 
STORY EDITOR. A member of ë writing staff above STAFF WRITER 
