SYNDICATION. The system of selling § series as packages to groups 
of stations and foreign markets after a network run is complete, usually 
requiring at least 88 °. A lucrative process that follows í’s 
first-run broadcast. 
TEASER. Also called PROLOGUE and COLD OPENING. Dramatic material 
before titles that may or may not be related to ð ¢ episode 
